      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَبٌ حَصْحَاصٌ</span></b>  <i>A laborious,</i> (K,) <i>quick nightjourney to water, in which is no flagging;</i> (As,
S, K;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَثْحَاثٌ</span>: (S:) or <i>such as is farextending,</i> or <i>long:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيْرٌ حَصْحَاصٌ</span> <i>a quick
journey,</i> or <i>pace;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَثْحَاثٌ</span>. (TA.)

